warning[W4001]  a/a.canon:5:8
  2 values were not evaluated or checked because a.A is broken: fix the errors in it or in the types it names

warning[W4001]  a/a.canon:11:8
  2 values were not evaluated or checked because a.B is broken: fix the errors in it or in the types it names

error[E3310]  a/a.canon:15:17
